<title>ITALY: Airtours, Carnival win bid for Costa -source.</title>
<headline>Airtours, Carnival win bid for Costa -source.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British holiday company Airtours Plc and its U.S. partner Carnival Corp's bid for Italy's Costa Crociere SpA has been successful, a financial source said.</p>
<p>According to available information on Friday, the last day for the bid, the joint 168 million stg bid had met with acceptances for about 95 percent of total Costa capital.</p>
<p>For the offer to become unconditional 90 percent of the ordinary shares needed to be tendered by June 6.</p>
<p>Costa's board had recommended its shareholders accept the bid. -- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
